@page "/notary-partners"

<PageTitle>Notary Partners — Join Our Network | Elevated Notary Services</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Join the Elevated Notary Services nationwide signing network. Independent contractor opportunities for vetted loan signing agents, RON notaries, and mobile notaries." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Nationwide Notary Network</span>
        <h1>Grow Your Business. Elevate Your Profession.</h1>
        <p>
            Elevated Notary Services is building a vetted nationwide network of dependable notaries and loan signing agents who value communication, accuracy, and ongoing professional growth.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="grid-2">
            <div class="card">
                <span class="eyebrow">Why Partner With ENS</span>
                <h2 style="font-size:2rem; margin:0.45rem 0 0.85rem;">Built to Support Dedicated Signing Agents</h2>
                <p>
                    We believe great closings start with well-supported signing professionals. Our partners receive clear assignment expectations, responsive coordination support, and a structured workflow designed for accuracy.
                </p>
                <ul class="check-list">
                    <li>Loan Signing Assignments (Purchase, Refinance, HELOC, Reverse, Commercial)</li>
                    <li>Remote Online Notarization (RON) Opportunities</li>
                    <li>Mobile &amp; General Notary Work</li>
                    <li>Assignment-Specific Coordination &amp; Support</li>
                    <li>Continuing Education &amp; Professional Standards</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="card-footer-cta">
                    <a href="https://form.jotform.com/262475935887073" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-gold">
                        Apply to Become an ENS Partner ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card card-featured">
                <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Minimum Vetting Standards</span>
                <h2 style="font-size:2rem; margin:0.45rem 0 0.85rem; color:#fff;">What We Look For</h2>
                <p>Every partner in the ENS network is evaluated based on credentials, reliability, and client-first professionalism.</p>
                <ul class="check-list">
                    <li>Active, in-good-standing state Notary Public commission</li>
                    <li>Current Errors &amp; Omissions (E&amp;O) insurance policy</li>
                    <li>Recent background screening &amp; loan signing certification</li>
                    <li>Dual-tray laser printer &amp; high-speed mobile/desktop scanner</li>
                    <li>Prompt communication &amp; punctual scanback/drop-off discipline</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="card-footer-cta">
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-light" style="width:100%;">Questions? Contact Coordination Desk</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
